==============================================================================
B. Honest oracle ceiling by feature granularity
==============================================================================

production residual MSE = 113,949  (RMSE 337.6s)
An oracle knowing the TRUE mean residual of each cell is the best any
feature at that granularity could ever do. Noise correction matters:
small cells fit noise for free.

  (airport, day) -- bounds ALL ADEP-side features
    cells=620  between=1,600 (1.4%)  noise-expected=205
